  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HyVpPan.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=关注&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>关于：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>奇幻矿石改进了原版《我的世界》的矿石，带来更佳的游戏体验。<br>灵感来源于《Hytale》，但融入了我的个人风格。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>3D矿石模型。</li>\n<li>3D黑曜石与哭泣黑曜石。</li>\n<li>3D紫水晶晶簇。</li>\n</ul><p>如需禁用“闪耀矿石”效果，请删除压缩包内的“optifine”文件夹。<br>模组支持版本请点击此处：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻矿石模组版</a> ❤<br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;若喜欢我的像素艺术风格，也可尝试：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗透视材质包</a> [兼容多版本《我的世界》、其他材质包及模组]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗素食图标</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷栏材质</a> [需手动下载并复制]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗酿造指南显示</a> [原版风格]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗深色界面</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗浅色界面</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak的奇幻矿石<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak的奇幻矿石</a>&nbsp;[模组版]</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>💝 致亲爱的赞助者们 💝</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><em>请记住，您可以通过官方<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">曼陀罗创作Patreon页面</a></span>支持我们，<br>在那里您将获取最新更新资讯，这能帮助我们为您呈现最佳品质的作品。</em></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
